WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.100
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.100 --> 00:10.900
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.900 --> 00:12.367
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.367 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.033
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.033 --> 00:19.467
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.467 --> 00:21.467
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.467 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.500
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.500 --> 00:29.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.333 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.467
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.467 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.600
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.600 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.833
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.833 --> 00:49.333
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.867 --> 00:54.867
[cheerful ukulele music]
【欢快的尤克里里音乐】

00:54.867 --> 01:01.667
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:01.667 --> 01:04.600
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:07.700 --> 01:09.967
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

01:09.967 --> 01:11.233
[mumbles indistinctly]
[含糊不清地咕哝]

01:11.233 --> 01:12.233
[crash]
[碰撞]

01:12.233 --> 01:15.067
- Meow, meow, meow, meow.
- 喵，喵，喵，喵。

01:15.067 --> 01:17.833
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:17.833 --> 01:19.100
- Yeah, I am ripped.
- 是的，我被撕裂了。

01:19.100 --> 01:21.233
- [grumbling meows]
- [抱怨的喵声]

01:21.233 --> 01:22.233
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

01:22.233 --> 01:23.233
- Meow!
- 喵！

01:23.233 --> 01:25.767
Meow.
喵。

01:25.767 --> 01:27.233
[snoring]
[打鼾]

01:31.267 --> 01:33.633
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:33.633 --> 01:34.633
Whoa!
哇！

01:34.633 --> 01:35.467
[thud]
[砰]

01:35.467 --> 01:36.867
[eyes pop]
[groans]
[眼睛突出]
[呻吟]

01:36.867 --> 01:37.900
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:37.900 --> 01:39.267
[steam hisses]
[蒸汽嘶嘶声]

01:39.267 --> 01:40.767
[screaming]
[尖叫]

01:40.767 --> 01:42.500
[clunk]
[groans]
[沉闷]
[呻吟]

01:42.500 --> 01:45.400
- Hey there, have you recently
been involved in an accident?
- 嘿，你最近有吗
遭遇过事故吗？

01:45.400 --> 01:48.267
Well, have you?
- Well, yes. Yes, I have.
嗯，你有吗？
- 嗯，是的。是的，我有。

01:48.267 --> 01:50.967
- Well, then you need
life insurance.
- 那么你需要
人寿保险。

01:50.967 --> 01:52.433
- Life insurance?
- 人寿保险？

01:52.433 --> 01:54.067
- What?
Is there an echo in here?
- 什么？
这里有回声吗？

01:54.067 --> 01:55.500
Do yourself a favor, kiddo.
帮自己一个忙，孩子。

01:55.500 --> 01:59.067
Sign here,
and you'll be protected.
在这里签名，
你会受到保护。

01:59.067 --> 02:01.433
- I--hmm? No.
Um...no.
- 我--嗯？不。
嗯...不。

02:01.433 --> 02:03.167
[rubber duck squeaks]
Wait--no.
[橡皮鸭吱吱声]
等等——不。

02:03.167 --> 02:04.567
Wait--
- Here!
等等——
- 在这里！

02:04.567 --> 02:07.067
- Ah!
Okay, thanks.
- 啊！
好的，谢谢。

02:07.067 --> 02:08.700
[pen squeaking]
[钢笔吱吱作响]

02:08.700 --> 02:11.433
- And while you're at it,
clumsy, why not buy two?
- 当你这样做的时候，
笨拙，为什么不买两个呢？

02:11.433 --> 02:13.533
- Okay.
[pen squeaking]
- 好的。
[钢笔吱吱作响]

02:13.533 --> 02:15.900
- [laughs gleefully]
- [高兴地笑]

02:15.900 --> 02:17.300
[knock at door]
- Ooh!
[敲门]
- 哦！

02:17.300 --> 02:19.500
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:19.500 --> 02:22.400
- Hey, SpongeBob!
You're in your underwear.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝！
你穿着内衣。

02:22.400 --> 02:23.733
That's cool.
这很酷。

02:23.733 --> 02:25.233
I got your mail.
我收到你的邮件了。

02:25.233 --> 02:26.333
What is it?
它是什么？

02:26.333 --> 02:27.733
[elastic stretches and pops]
[弹性拉伸和弹出]

02:27.733 --> 02:30.900
- It's my life insurance.
I got one for you too.
- 这是我的人寿保险。
我也给你准备了一份。

02:30.900 --> 02:32.967
- Oh, boy! Life insurance!
- 哦，孩子！人寿保险！

02:32.967 --> 02:34.433
[boinging]
Life insurance!
[轰鸣声]
人寿保险！

02:34.433 --> 02:35.867
Life insurance!
人寿保险！

02:35.867 --> 02:37.200
Life insurance!
[crash]
人寿保险！
[碰撞]

02:37.200 --> 02:39.567
Life insurance!
人寿保险！

02:39.567 --> 02:41.833
What's life insurance?
什么是人寿保险？

02:41.833 --> 02:43.833
- I'm not sure,
but I think it means
- 我不确定，
但我认为这意味着

02:43.833 --> 02:46.900
that for the rest of our lives,
we are protected.
在我们的余生中，
我们受到保护。

02:46.900 --> 02:48.833
We can't get hurt.
我们不能受伤。

02:48.833 --> 02:51.067
- Mm...
- 毫米...

02:51.067 --> 02:53.233
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

02:53.233 --> 02:56.867
[spits]
The contract tastes legitimate,
[吐口水]
合同味道合法，

02:56.867 --> 02:59.067
but I don't believe it.
但我不相信。

02:59.067 --> 03:00.933
- Well, let's try to get hurt,
and we'll see.
- 好吧，让我们试着受伤吧，
我们拭目以待。

03:00.933 --> 03:04.067
- Ha! Well, finally,
something I'm good at.
- 哈！好吧，最后，
我擅长的事情。

03:05.867 --> 03:07.300
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:07.300 --> 03:09.233
[grunts]
- Remarkable.
[咕哝]
- 了不起。

03:09.233 --> 03:10.700
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:10.700 --> 03:12.733
- You can hit me all you want...
- [grunts]
- 你想打我就打吧...
- [咕哝]

03:12.733 --> 03:14.500
- Yet I can't be damaged.
- 但我不能被伤害。

03:14.500 --> 03:16.567
This life insurance
is really working.
这份人寿保险
确实有效。

03:16.567 --> 03:19.833
- [grunts]
I've become unbreakable!
- [咕哝]
我已经变得坚不可摧了！

03:19.833 --> 03:21.533
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:21.533 --> 03:22.967
[relaxing music]
[轻松的音乐]

03:22.967 --> 03:25.767
- Why, yes, I do race
sea horses.
- 为什么，是的，我参加比赛
海马。

03:25.767 --> 03:28.067
[squishy smash]
[laughter and grunting]
[软软的粉碎]
[笑声和咕哝声]

03:28.067 --> 03:30.100
Oh, I don't know
if I'd call myself
哦，我不知道
如果我打电话给自己

03:30.100 --> 03:32.767
an international playboy.
国际花花公子

03:32.767 --> 03:35.067
[laughter and grunting]
[growls]
[笑声和咕哝声]
[咆哮]

03:35.067 --> 03:36.300
[both laughing]
- [grunts]
[两人都笑了]
- [咕哝]

03:36.300 --> 03:37.633
- [laughs]
[bonk]
- [笑]
[棒棒哒]

03:37.633 --> 03:41.067
- Just what are you two
ignorami doing out here?
-你们两个到底是什么人
无知的人在这里做什么？

03:41.067 --> 03:42.600
- We're trying to hurt
each other.
- 我们试图伤害
彼此。

03:42.600 --> 03:44.767
- Oh!
- Don't--hey--what the--
- 哦！
- 别--嘿--那是什么--

03:44.767 --> 03:47.267
- You got a sea spider
on your head.
- 你有一只海蜘蛛
在你的头上。

03:47.267 --> 03:49.367
- It's not a sea spider,
you dope.
- 这不是海蜘蛛
你这个笨蛋。

03:49.367 --> 03:51.833
It's my hair.
这是我的头发。

03:51.833 --> 03:53.267
both: Mm...
两人：嗯……

03:54.600 --> 03:56.600
[bonking and laughter]
[碰撞和笑声]

03:56.600 --> 03:59.700
- Wait a second.
Hurt each other?
- 等一下。
互相伤害？

03:59.700 --> 04:03.367
Oh, I'm gonna enjoy
seeing this.
哦，我会享受的
看到这个。

04:03.367 --> 04:04.533
- [laughs]
[clunk]
- [笑]
[沉闷]

04:04.533 --> 04:05.967
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:05.967 --> 04:07.200
Whoa!
[boing]
哇！
[嗡嗡声]

04:07.200 --> 04:08.867
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

04:08.867 --> 04:10.233
- Stop! Stop! Stop!
- 停止！停止！停止！

04:10.233 --> 04:12.533
I thought you said you were
trying to hurt each other.
我以为你说你是
试图伤害对方。

04:12.533 --> 04:13.800
- Uh-huh, we're trying.
- 嗯嗯，我们正在努力。

04:13.800 --> 04:15.467
- Well, you're not
gonna do any damage
- 好吧，你不是
会造成任何伤害

04:15.467 --> 04:17.300
with soft pillows.
和柔软的枕头。

04:17.300 --> 04:19.767
Here, try this.
来，试试这个。

04:19.767 --> 04:23.133
- Okay.
- [screams]
- 好的。
- [尖叫]

04:23.133 --> 04:25.067
- Squidward was wrong.
- 章鱼哥错了。

04:25.067 --> 04:27.600
Didn't hurt him,
just made him disappear.
没有伤害他，
刚刚让他消失了。

04:29.233 --> 04:31.533
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

04:31.533 --> 04:33.800
Ah! Sea spider!
啊!海蜘蛛！

04:33.800 --> 04:35.833
[metallic smashing]
[grunting]
[金属粉碎]
[咕噜声]

04:35.833 --> 04:38.533
Uh!
[mumbles indistinctly]
呃！
[含糊不清地咕哝]

04:38.533 --> 04:40.600
- Oh--oh, no, Patrick,
I'm slipping...
- 哦——哦，不，帕特里克，
我滑倒了...

04:40.600 --> 04:42.333
and falling!
[screams]
和坠落！
[尖叫声]

04:42.333 --> 04:43.800
[thud]
[砰]

04:43.800 --> 04:45.533
I didn't even break a bone!
我连一根骨头都没有骨折！

04:45.533 --> 04:46.900
- My turn!
- 轮到我了！

04:46.900 --> 04:49.067
[stammering]
I'm losing my footing!
[结巴]
我快要失去立足点了！

04:49.067 --> 04:50.100
No!
不！

04:50.100 --> 04:53.533
I survived a deadly fall unhurt!
我从致命的坠落中幸存下来，没有受伤！

04:53.533 --> 04:55.100
- Life insurance.
- 人寿保险。

04:55.100 --> 04:58.067
- Hi-ya! Hi-ya!
- 嗨呀！嗨呀！

04:58.067 --> 05:00.967
- What?
I can't hear you!
- 什么？
我听不到你说话！

05:00.967 --> 05:02.133
- Hi-ya!
- 嗨呀！

05:02.133 --> 05:07.100
- Turn the volume up
inside of your voice!
- 调高音量
在你的声音里！

05:07.100 --> 05:09.300
- I said--
[screams]
- 我说--
[尖叫声]

05:09.300 --> 05:10.900
[mumbles indistinctly]
[含糊不清地咕哝]

05:10.900 --> 05:12.667
- Squidward,
what were you yelling?
- 章鱼哥，
你喊什么？

05:12.667 --> 05:14.533
- I was trying to say
- 我想说

05:14.533 --> 05:18.400
you got to fall
from something higher.
你必须跌倒
来自更高的东西。

05:18.400 --> 05:19.467
- Sea spider!
- 海蜘蛛！

05:19.467 --> 05:21.367
[smashing and grunting]
[粉碎和咕哝]

05:21.367 --> 05:24.500
[whistles buzzing]
[口哨声响起]

05:26.633 --> 05:28.167
- [startled mumbling]
- [吃惊的咕哝]

05:28.167 --> 05:30.233
[splash]
Ah! My baby.
[飞溅]
啊！我的宝贝。

05:30.233 --> 05:32.067
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

05:32.067 --> 05:34.933
[whistles buzzing]
- Once again, I'm asking,
[口哨声响起]
- 我再一次问，

05:34.933 --> 05:37.100
what are you doing?
- It's our final test.
你在干什么？
- 这是我们的最后测试。

05:37.100 --> 05:38.733
We're trying to get
jellyfish to sting us
我们正在努力获得
水母蜇我们

05:38.733 --> 05:40.500
to prove we can't get hurt.
来证明我们不会受伤。

05:40.500 --> 05:42.433
- What?
- 什么？

05:42.433 --> 05:45.400
- [inhales deeply]
[horn blares]
- [深吸一口气]
[喇叭声]

05:45.400 --> 05:47.433
- Oh! Me! Me!
Sting me! Over here!
- 哦！我！我！
蜇我吧！在这里！

05:47.433 --> 05:49.633
- Sting me, sting me, sting me.
- Blast me with your venom!
- 蜇我，蜇我，蜇我。
- 用你的毒液攻击我！

05:49.633 --> 05:51.967
- Zap me with your pain juice!
- 用你的痛苦汁来攻击我！

05:51.967 --> 05:53.633
- Sting me, please!
- Sting me, sting me, sting me.
- 请蜇我吧！
- 蜇我，蜇我，蜇我。

05:53.633 --> 05:55.100
- You're the ones asking--
[zap]
- 你是在问的人--
[扎普]

05:55.100 --> 05:57.900
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:57.900 --> 06:01.633
- Gee, Squidward, maybe you
should get some life insurance.
- 哎呀，章鱼哥，也许是你
应该买一些人寿保险。

06:01.633 --> 06:04.367
[crusty cracking]
- What are you yammering about?
[硬皮破裂]
- 你在抱怨什么？

06:04.367 --> 06:06.733
- I bought some life insurance
for Patrick and myself,
- 我买了一些人寿保险
对于帕特里克和我自己来说，

06:06.733 --> 06:08.867
and now we can never be hurt.
现在我们永远不会受到伤害。

06:08.867 --> 06:11.967
- Yeah.
To test out the life insurance,
- 是的。
为了测试人寿保险，

06:11.967 --> 06:15.733
we even built a super dangerous
obstacle course
我们甚至建造了一个超级危险的
障碍训练场

06:15.733 --> 06:17.067
across the street.
街对面。

06:17.067 --> 06:19.333
- We call it The Sushi Maker.
- 我们称之为寿司机。

06:19.333 --> 06:20.900
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

06:20.900 --> 06:23.200
Squidward, I think
you need this more than I.
我觉得章鱼哥
你比我更需要这个。

06:23.200 --> 06:28.067
I would like to present you
with my life insurance policy.
我想向您介绍
和我的人寿保险单。

06:28.067 --> 06:30.567
- [groans]
- Actually, you better take two,
- [呻吟]
- 事实上，你最好带两个，

06:30.567 --> 06:32.133
since you're kind of a klutz.
因为你有点笨手笨脚。

06:32.133 --> 06:33.367
[thud]
[grunts]
[砰]
[咕哝]

06:33.367 --> 06:35.667
- Better take two?
Life insurance?
- 最好带两个？
人寿保险？

06:35.667 --> 06:37.833
[growls] You giblet heads!
[咆哮]你们这些内脏头！

06:37.833 --> 06:40.967
No piece of paper can protect
a person from getting hurt.
没有一张纸可以保护
一个人免遭伤害。

06:40.967 --> 06:42.467
[both gasp]
- [whimpers]
[两人都喘气]
- [呜咽]

06:42.467 --> 06:44.167
- Yay! It works!
- 耶！有用！

06:44.167 --> 06:45.567
- You're untouchable!
- 你是不可触碰的！

06:45.567 --> 06:48.500
- Oh, that was a coincidence.
- 哦，那是巧合。

06:48.500 --> 06:50.367
- Driving's hard.
- 开车很难。

06:50.367 --> 06:51.933
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:51.933 --> 06:53.667
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

06:53.667 --> 06:57.467
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:57.467 --> 06:59.600
both: Yay! Life insurance!
两人：耶！人寿保险！

06:59.600 --> 07:01.500
- You are
magically protected.
- 你是
受到魔法保护。

07:01.500 --> 07:03.433
-Whoo-hoo!
- Whoo!
-呼呼！
- 呼！

07:03.433 --> 07:05.633
- Oh, it was luck!
Dumb luck!
- 哦，这真是运气好！
运气真好啊！

07:05.633 --> 07:07.067
[thunder rumbling]
[雷声隆隆]

07:07.067 --> 07:09.967
Look, I'll prove it.
You stand here.
听着，我会证明这一点。
你站在这里。

07:09.967 --> 07:12.400
[zapping]
[both wailing]
[电击]
[双双哀嚎]

07:12.400 --> 07:13.933
- Huh? Hmm? Oh.
- 啊？唔？哦。

07:13.933 --> 07:15.633
- You see, Squidward?
You're immune!
- 你看到了吗，章鱼哥？
你已经免疫了！

07:15.633 --> 07:17.533
- You can't be hurt!
- Yeah!
- 你不能受伤！
- 是的！

07:17.533 --> 07:20.167
- You are a cast-iron
Squidward.
- 你是铸铁
章鱼哥。

07:20.167 --> 07:23.067
both: Life insurance!
Life insurance!
两者：人寿保险！
人寿保险！

07:23.067 --> 07:24.633
- Wow, I can't believe it,
- 哇，我简直不敢相信，

07:24.633 --> 07:27.867
but you two sub-geniuses
were right somehow.
但你们两个次天才
不知何故是对的。

07:27.867 --> 07:31.333
I can't be broken.
I'm indestructible!
我不能被打破。
我是坚不可摧的！

07:31.333 --> 07:33.933
I am shatterproof!
我是防碎的！

07:33.933 --> 07:35.967
Watch this.
[pop]
注意这个。
[流行音乐]

07:35.967 --> 07:38.067
[cheerful ukulele music]
【欢快的尤克里里音乐】

07:38.067 --> 07:39.433
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

07:39.433 --> 07:40.467
- What you gonna do,
Squidward?
- 你要做什么，
章鱼哥？

07:40.467 --> 07:41.567
- What does it look like?
- 它看起来像什么？

07:41.567 --> 07:42.900
I'm running into a...
我遇到了一个...

07:42.900 --> 07:44.700
[fabric tears]
Wall!
[布料的眼泪]
墙！

07:44.700 --> 07:47.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

07:47.067 --> 07:48.233
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:48.233 --> 07:50.600
Yes.
That's just what it needed.
是的。
这正是它所需要的。

07:50.600 --> 07:53.367
I'll call the painting
"One Hole."
我会给这幅画打电话
“一个洞。”

07:53.367 --> 07:54.900
Oh, it's genius!
哦，真是天才！

07:54.900 --> 07:56.200
[both panting]
[fabric tears]
[两人都气喘吁吁]
[布料的眼泪]

07:56.200 --> 07:58.700
Ugh! Three holes?
啊!三孔？

07:58.700 --> 08:00.200
That makes no sense!
这毫无意义！

08:01.600 --> 08:02.833
- Did you see that?
- 你看到了吗？

08:02.833 --> 08:04.533
I ran right through
a brick wall.
我直接跑过去
一堵砖墙。

08:04.533 --> 08:06.533
I'm hard as nails!
我就像钉子一样坚硬！

08:06.533 --> 08:09.667
Come on, world!
Bring it on!
加油吧，世界！
来吧！

08:09.667 --> 08:12.800
- Hmm.
[panting]
- 唔。
[气喘吁吁]

08:14.567 --> 08:16.433
- Oh, perfect.
- 哦，完美。

08:16.433 --> 08:17.900
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

08:17.900 --> 08:21.067
- Pfft. Big tough guy.
- 噗。大硬汉。

08:21.067 --> 08:22.533
- What are you doing,
Squidward?
- 你在做什么，
章鱼哥？

08:22.533 --> 08:24.067
- Just watch.
- 就看吧。

08:24.067 --> 08:25.967
- [slurps]
[grumbles]
- [啜饮]
[抱怨]

08:25.967 --> 08:28.867
- Enjoying your sherbert,
Herbert?
- 享受你的果子露，
赫伯特？

08:28.867 --> 08:30.767
- My name's not Herbert.
- 我的名字不是赫伯特。

08:30.767 --> 08:32.667
- Oh, I know it's not.
- 哦，我知道不是。

08:32.667 --> 08:35.833
Your name is "Hey."
What's your name?
你的名字叫“嘿”。
你叫什么名字？

08:35.833 --> 08:37.400
[smack]
- Hey!
[咂]
- 嘿！

08:37.400 --> 08:39.900
- Told ya!
Here, let me help you.
- 告诉你了！
在这里，让我来帮助你。

08:39.900 --> 08:43.567
[wallop]
- [groans]
[冲击力]
- [呻吟]

08:43.567 --> 08:46.267
- Funny, didn't feel a thing.
- 有趣的是，没有任何感觉。

08:46.267 --> 08:48.100
- Uh, Squidward, I don't think
you should lick that.
- 呃，章鱼哥，我不认为
你应该舔那个。

08:48.100 --> 08:51.400
It's got germs.
- Ha! Germs can't hurt me.
它有细菌。
- 哈！细菌无法伤害我。

08:51.400 --> 08:53.900
Nothing can hurt me!
没有什么可以伤害我！

08:53.900 --> 08:56.667
[germs screaming]
[细菌尖叫]

08:56.667 --> 08:57.667
[whoosh]
[嗖嗖]

08:57.667 --> 08:59.233
[splat]
[啪嗒]

08:59.233 --> 09:00.567
As a matter of fact,
事实上，

09:00.567 --> 09:02.133
do you know
what I'm gonna do now?
你知道吗
我现在要做什么？

09:02.133 --> 09:05.333
I'm gonna run your
super dangerous obstacle course.
我要运行你的
超级危险的障碍赛。

09:05.333 --> 09:07.467
You know why?
你知道为什么吗？

09:07.467 --> 09:08.733
- Mm-mm.
- No.
- 嗯嗯。
- 不。

09:08.733 --> 09:12.567
- Because now I've got moxie!
- 因为现在我有勇气了！

09:12.567 --> 09:14.067
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

09:14.067 --> 09:16.067
both: Wait, what's moxie?
两人：等等，莫西是什么？

09:17.067 --> 09:20.233
[heavy metal music]
[重金属音乐]

09:20.233 --> 09:24.200
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:24.200 --> 09:25.233
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

09:25.233 --> 09:29.600
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:29.600 --> 09:31.333
[legs clattering]
[腿嘎嘎作响]

09:31.333 --> 09:32.967
- What goes on, boyos?
- 发生什么事了，男孩？

09:32.967 --> 09:35.567
- Squidward is gonna try out
The Sushi Maker.
- 章鱼哥要尝试一下
寿司师傅。

09:35.567 --> 09:38.233
- Why does he want to do that?
- Oh, don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
- 他为什么要这么做？
-哦，别担心，蟹老板。

09:38.233 --> 09:41.700
He's got life insurance.
He can't be hurt.
他有人寿保险。
他不能受伤。

09:41.700 --> 09:44.633
- That's not how
life insurance works.
- 不是这样的
人寿保险有效。

09:44.633 --> 09:46.833
- It's not?
- Course not!
- 它不是？
- 当然不是！

09:46.833 --> 09:48.867
Life insurance is money
the beneficiary gets
人寿保险就是钱
受益人得到

09:48.867 --> 09:50.500
when a person dies.
当一个人去世时。

09:50.500 --> 09:52.400
By the way, who gets the money?
顺便问一下，谁能拿到钱？

09:52.400 --> 09:53.533
- Well, let's see.
- 好吧，让我们看看。

09:53.533 --> 09:56.067
[slide whistle ascending]
[滑哨上升]

09:57.467 --> 09:59.267
No name here.
- Hooray!
这里没有名字。
- 万岁！

09:59.267 --> 10:00.267
Hmm.
唔。

10:00.267 --> 10:01.233
[pen clicks]
[笔点击]

10:01.233 --> 10:04.367
[mumbling]
Eugene H. Krabs.
[咕哝]
尤金·克拉布斯 (Eugene H. Krabs)

10:04.367 --> 10:05.967
Go, Squidward!
走吧，章鱼哥！

10:05.967 --> 10:06.933
Yay!
耶！

10:06.933 --> 10:09.133
Fly high! Do or die!
飞得更高！要么做，要么死！

10:09.133 --> 10:11.967
Preferably the latter.
[cackles]
最好是后者。
[咯咯笑]

10:11.967 --> 10:14.567
- D-d-d-d-do or die?
- D-D-D-D-做还是死？

10:14.567 --> 10:15.833
Squidward, come down!
章鱼哥，下来！

10:15.833 --> 10:17.067
You're not invincible!
你不是无敌的！

10:17.067 --> 10:18.933
Life insurance
is not what you think!
人寿保险
不是你想的那样！

10:18.933 --> 10:21.800
You were right!
Oh, it was just dumb luck.
你是对的！
哦，这只是运气不好。

10:21.800 --> 10:23.433
- Now I'm yelling too!
- 现在我也大喊大叫了！

10:23.433 --> 10:26.400
- Oh, what are those ninnies
going on about now?
-哦，那些傻瓜是什么？
现在正在进行什么？

10:26.400 --> 10:28.067
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

10:28.067 --> 10:31.900
Just shut up and watch me.
闭嘴，看着我。

10:31.900 --> 10:33.900
[plop]
Nah--hey!
[扑通]
不——嘿！

10:33.900 --> 10:36.033
- Come back, Squidward!
Don't do this!
- 回来吧，章鱼哥！
不要这样做！

10:36.033 --> 10:38.433
- Will you stop shaking it?
- 你能停止摇动它吗？

10:38.433 --> 10:39.667
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:39.667 --> 10:41.233
[bubbles gurgling]
[咕噜咕噜的泡泡]

10:41.233 --> 10:43.333
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:43.333 --> 10:44.867
[clunk]
[沉闷]

10:44.867 --> 10:46.533
[slide whistle
ascends and descends]
[幻灯片哨子
上升和下降]

10:46.533 --> 10:48.033
[clunk]
[沉闷]

10:48.033 --> 10:50.433
[thud]
[machine hisses]
[砰]
[机器嘶嘶声]

10:50.433 --> 10:52.033
No, no, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不，不！

10:52.033 --> 10:54.700
[sticky scrunches]
[strained shouting]
[粘稠的皱褶]
[紧张的喊叫]

10:54.700 --> 10:56.467
[pop]
[流行音乐]

10:56.467 --> 10:59.467
[wallops and groans]
[冲击力和呻吟声]

10:59.467 --> 11:02.400
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

11:02.400 --> 11:04.233
[splatters and groans]
[mechanical rattling]
[飞溅和呻吟]
[机械嘎嘎声]

11:04.233 --> 11:07.133
Ow...
Eeh! Eeh! Eeh!
噢...
呃！呃！呃！

11:07.133 --> 11:10.067
[muffled shouting]
[mechanical humming]
[低声喊叫]
[机械嗡嗡声]

11:10.067 --> 11:12.867
[cannon booms]
[screams]
[大炮隆隆]
[尖叫声]

11:12.867 --> 11:13.867
[clunk]
[groans]
[沉闷]
[呻吟]

11:13.867 --> 11:14.967
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

11:14.967 --> 11:16.533
[thud]
[grunts]
[砰]
[咕哝]

11:16.533 --> 11:19.100
[kids chattering indistinctly]
[squeaking and honking]
[孩子们含糊不清地叽叽喳喳]
[吱吱声和喇叭声]

11:19.100 --> 11:20.467
Ow...
噢...

11:20.467 --> 11:22.067
- Hey, Squidward,
guess what I learned today.
- 嘿，章鱼哥，
猜猜我今天学到了什么。

11:22.067 --> 11:24.067
Apparently,
a life insurance policy
显然，
人寿保险单

11:24.067 --> 11:25.533
doesn't protect
a person from injury.
不保护
一个人免受伤害。

11:25.533 --> 11:30.233
Heh, how about that?
- Ha, how 'bout that?
呵呵，那怎么样？
- 哈，那怎么样？

11:30.233 --> 11:32.067
[spits]
[吐口水]

11:32.067 --> 11:36.500
- Squidward, how did you survive
The Sushi Maker?
- 章鱼哥，你是怎么活下来的
寿司师傅？

11:38.067 --> 11:39.067
[pop]
[grunts]
[流行音乐]
[咕哝]

11:39.067 --> 11:40.933
It had to be this.
一定是这个。

11:40.933 --> 11:42.933
- Ah!
both: Sea spider!
- 啊！
两人：海蜘蛛！

11:42.933 --> 11:44.433
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

11:47.067 --> 11:50.067
[upbeat seafaring music]
[欢快的航海音乐]

[欢快的航海音乐]